{{Object Infobox|title=Forbidden Glow|image1=[[File:Forbidden Glow Spell.png|250px]]|type=[[Spells|Spell]]|users=[[Witches]],[[Coco]]|manga=[[Chapter 1]]}}'''Forbidden glow''' is a [[Spells|spell]] of unknown type which creates glowing sparkles of light.

==Description==
This spell is composed of a ring of column signs with an unknown central sigil. It's effect appears to be similar to that of a light-based spell, but whether or not the spell is forbidden is unknown.

==Usage==
This spell was the first one [[Coco]] ever drew, copied from the [[Magic Book|picture book]] sold to her by [[Iguin]]. Other spells Coco is known to have copied include [[Forbidden Flames|forbidden flames]] and [[Petrification|petrification]].{{Ref|m|1|47}}

